  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#the-link-element\r\n\r\n> [[CEReactions](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#cereactions)] attribute DOMTokenList [blocking](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#dom-link-blocking);\r\n\r\nIt should use the same extended attributes as `relList` and be `readonly`:\r\n\r\n> [SameObject, PutForwards=[value](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-domtokenlist-value)] readonly attribute [DOMTokenList](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-domtokenlist) [relList](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#dom-link-rellist);\r\n\r\n@domenic @xiaochengh ",
